{"id":"otnoshenie","lemma":"отношение","pos":"noun","rank":919,"glosses":["attitude","treatment","relation, regard, respect, consideration"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a4/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"отношения","plural":"отношения"},"examples":[{"text":"Мне нравится его отношение.","en":"I like his attitude.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"},{"g":"him / his"},null]},{"text":"Между нами всегда были хорошие отношения.","en":"We've always had a good relationship.","words":[{"g":"between, among"},{"g":"we","l":"мы"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null]},{"text":"Мы хотим знать ваше отношение.","en":"We want to know where you stand.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]},{"text":"Я не имею к этому отношения.","en":"I have nothing to do with it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have, to possess","l":"иметь"},{"g":"to"},null,null]},{"text":"У нас с ними хорошие отношения.","en":"We're on good terms with them.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"with / from"},null,{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null]}]}